@startuml
autonumber
title Sequence Diagram - Use Case Checkout & VNPay Payment Flow (BrewLite)
skinparam BoxPadding 10
<style>
participant {
  Padding 8
}
</style>

actor "Customer" as User
boundary "Next.js UI\n(/checkout)" as FE
control "OrdersController" as OC
control "PaymentsController" as PC
entity "OrdersService" as OS
entity "StockService" as SS
entity "OrderStatusService" as OStS
entity "VnpayService" as VS
database "PostgreSQL\n(Prisma ORM)" as DB
boundary "VNPay Gateway\n(Sandbox v2.1.0)" as Gateway

== 1. Khởi tạo đơn hàng & Kiểm soát tồn kho đồng thời (OCC) ==

User -> FE: Nhấn "Thanh toán ngay"
activate User
activate FE

FE -> OC: POST /orders\nHeader: Authorization: Bearer <JWT>\nHeader: Idempotency-Key: <key-uuid>\nBody: { items, promoCode }
activate OC

OC -> OC: JwtAuthGuard: Giải mã JWT lấy userId
OC -> OS: create(userId, dto, { idempotencyKey })
activate OS

OS -> DB: findUnique(Order where { userId_idempotencyKey })
activate DB
DB --> OS: null (Chưa tạo đơn)
deactivate DB

OS -> DB: Mở $transaction
activate DB

OS -> SS: reserve(tx, items)
activate SS
note over SS, DB
  Optimistic Locking (OCC):
  UPDATE "Product"
  SET stock = stock - qty, version = version + 1
  WHERE id = ? AND version = ? AND stock >= qty
end note

SS -> DB: updateMany(Product where version, stock >= qty)
alt #LightPink Không đủ tồn kho hoặc xung đột phiên bản (Affected Rows = 0)
    DB --> SS: count = 0
    SS --> OS: throw ConflictException({ code: 'OUT_OF_STOCK', productId })
    deactivate SS
    OS -> DB: Rollback transaction
    OS --> OC: throw ConflictException
    deactivate OS
    OC --> FE: 409 Conflict { code: "OUT_OF_STOCK", productId }
    deactivate OC
    FE --> User: Báo hết hàng trên giao diện, giữ nguyên giỏ hàng
else #LightGreen Trừ tồn kho thành công (Affected Rows > 0)
    DB --> SS: count = 1
    SS --> OS: reserve success
    deactivate SS
    activate OS
    activate OC
    OS -> DB: Áp mã Promotion (nếu có) & Tạo Order (status = PENDING)
    DB --> OS: Trả về bản ghi Order mới (#orderId: 1001)
    OS -> DB: Commit transaction
    deactivate DB
    OS --> OC: CreateOrderResult ({ orderId: 1001, status: PENDING, total: 45000 })
    deactivate OS
    OC --> FE: 201 Created { orderId: 1001, status: "PENDING", total: 45000 }
    deactivate OC
end

== 2. Khởi tạo URL Thanh toán VNPay Sandbox ==

FE -> PC: POST /payments/vnpay/create-url\nHeader: Bearer <JWT>\nBody: { orderId: 1001, method: "WALLET" }
activate PC

PC -> VS: createPaymentUrl({ orderId, amount, method, ipAddr })
activate VS
note over VS
  Chuẩn hóa GMT+7 & hạn 15 phút:
  vnp_TxnRef = 1001XWALLETX...
  Ký số HMAC-SHA512 với VNP_HASH_SECRET
end note
VS --> PC: paymentUrl ("https://sandbox.vnpayment.vn/...")
deactivate VS

PC --> FE: 200 OK { paymentUrl }
deactivate PC

FE -> User: window.location.href = paymentUrl (Chuyển hướng trình duyệt)
deactivate FE
deactivate User

User -> Gateway: Xác thực thanh toán (Quét VNPAY-QR / Thẻ NCB OTP)
activate User
activate Gateway

== 3. Nhận thông báo IPN (Server-to-Server) & Hoàn tất đơn hàng ==

Gateway -> PC: GET /payments/vnpay/ipn (Server-to-Server ngầm)\n?vnp_ResponseCode=00&vnp_TxnRef=1001...&vnp_SecureHash=...
activate PC

PC -> VS: verifyCallback(query)
activate VS
VS --> PC: { isValid: true, isSuccess: true, orderId: 1001, amount: 45000 }
deactivate VS

alt #LightGreen Chữ ký hợp lệ & Giao dịch thành công (ResponseCode = '00')
    PC -> DB: Mở $transaction (khóa FOR UPDATE)
    activate DB
    PC -> OStS: transition(tx, 1001, PAID)
    activate OStS
    OStS -> DB: Update Order status = PAID
    OStS --> PC: order updated
    deactivate OStS
    PC -> DB: Payment.create(status: SUCCEEDED, method: "WALLET", UUID, SHA-256)
    PC -> DB: LoyaltyHooksService.onPaid() -> User.points += points
    DB --> PC: Commit transaction
    deactivate DB
    PC --> Gateway: 200 OK { RspCode: "00", Message: "success" }
    deactivate PC

    Gateway --> FE: Redirect trình duyệt khách về /orders/vnpay-return?...
    activate FE
    FE -> PC: GET /payments/vnpay/return?vnp_...
    activate PC
    PC -> VS: verifyCallback(query)
    activate VS
    VS --> PC: { isValid: true, isSuccess: true, orderId: 1001 }
    deactivate VS
    PC --> FE: 200 OK { isValid: true, isSuccess: true, orderId: 1001 }
    deactivate PC
    FE -> FE: Xóa giỏ hàng (useCart.clear()) & dọn session
    FE --> User: Hiển thị màn hình đặt hàng thành công (#1001 - PAID)
    deactivate FE
    deactivate User
else #LightPink Giao dịch thất bại hoặc khách hủy (ResponseCode != '00')
    activate PC
    PC -> DB: Mở $transaction
    activate DB
    PC -> OStS: transition(tx, 1001, PAYMENT_FAILED)
    activate OStS
    OStS -> DB: Update Order status = PAYMENT_FAILED
    OStS --> PC: order updated
    deactivate OStS
    PC -> DB: Payment.create(status: FAILED, failureReason)
    DB --> PC: Commit transaction
    deactivate DB
    PC --> Gateway: 200 OK { RspCode: "00", Message: "success" }
    deactivate PC

    Gateway --> FE: Redirect về /orders/vnpay-return?...
    activate FE
    FE --> User: Hiển thị lỗi thanh toán, cho phép chọn "Thử lại" hoặc "Hủy đơn"
    deactivate FE
    deactivate User
end

deactivate Gateway
@enduml
